>	Is there a time limit or a random number generator which will
>cause the dungeon to collapse (or does my Nethack have a mind of its own)

When NetHack says the "dungeon collapses", that means something went wrong
in the game and was unrecoverable.  There is no such "counter", dungeon
collapses should never happen.  In NetHack 1.4, there was a bug that prevented
NetHack from making "B"s (bats), and it would regularly crash the game in
the deeper levels.  I suggest upgrading to version 3.0, available from
uunet.uu.net or linc.cis.upenn.edu.
